  "_comment": "Demo profile (WP-32/34). Sized 2026-09-15 for high utilisation at low gas: half the arrivals, roughly double the size. Regular intents median ~210 USDC, whales 260-310 \u2014 just under the House Vault's 315 per-fill cap and well over every other vault's 225, so whales land where there is room and walk one vault per chain to its 80% exposure cap while the rest still show depth. About 30 intents an hour, ~8,000 USDC of throughput, roughly 1,600 in flight against 3,240 of vault capital (the contract ceiling is 80%, so that is about two thirds of what the market can carry). Halving the rate halves Sepolia gas, which is the real running cost; in-flight volume is bot money, which is the other.",
